<title>USA: Federal Realty in $84 million offering.</title>
<headline>Federal Realty in $84 million offering.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Realty Investment Trust said it sold three million common shares priced at $28 to an unnamed equity mutual fund.</p>
<p>The transaction will close February 4. Federal will use the $83.9 million raised from the sale to repay debt on its revolving credit facility.</p>
</text>
